# Pawlix phases

The source of truth is `pet-commerce-master-build-spec.md`. Domain: pawlix.com.

- Work only on the current approved phase. Do not implement later phases.
- Current work: Phase 0 foundation is in place. SKU generation/permissions modules exist early because the owner requested them. Admin SKU UI still belongs to Phase 3.
- Do not start Phase 1 (Supabase) until the user approves.
- Prefer existing project utilities. Do not add component, form, animation, or state libraries for convenience.
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` or other server secrets to the browser.
- Never bypass RLS as a shortcut.
- After a phase, summarize, then stop and wait for approval.
